   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Anima Reference Adapter (advanced)\n\nThe separate nodes, for the pilot adapter and for options the one-node workflow does not expose.\n\n- **Anima Ref Latent** fits the reference into the output size (white letterbox) and returns the empty latent for that size. The pilot needs the reference at the output size; v2 reads any size.\n- **Anima Ref Guider** (`SamplerCustomAdvanced`): `cfg`, `ref_guidance`, `correction`, and the window `ref_start` / `ref_end` with `outside` = keep the reference without extra guidance, or drop it.\n- **Anima Ref Adapter Loader**: keep `ref_offset_h` at 1.0 (training value).\n"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
